# 🔌 REST API

يتواصل الـ Frontend مع الـ Backend من خلال REST APIs.

أمثلة على الـ Endpoints:

```text
Authentication
POST   /api/auth/register
POST   /api/auth/login

Categories
POST   /api/category/add
GET    /api/category/list
DELETE /api/category/remove

Food
POST   /api/food/addfood
GET    /api/food/list
DELETE /api/food/removefood
PUT    /api/food/updatefood

Users
GET    /api/user/list

Orders
POST   /api/order/create
GET    /api/order/list
```

